<view class="page-shell systems-page">
  <block wx:if="{{!result}}">
    <view class="system-switch"
      ><button
        class="system-choice {{systemId === 'bazi' ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-system="bazi"
        bindtap="handleSystem"
        aria-pressed="{{systemId === 'bazi'}}"
      >
        八字</button
      ><button
        class="system-choice {{systemId === 'ziwei' ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-system="ziwei"
        bindtap="handleSystem"
        aria-pressed="{{systemId === 'ziwei'}}"
      >
        紫微斗数
      </button></view
    >
    <view class="hero-title"
      >{{systemId === 'bazi' ? '看看自己的节奏' : '认识十二宫的自己'}}</view
    ><view class="hero-copy">填入出生信息，生成一张本机命盘。</view>
    <view class="panel-card form-card">
      <view class="form-field"
        ><view class="form-label">出生日期</view
        ><view class="system-switch date-switch"
          ><button
            class="system-choice {{dateType === 'solar' ? 'active' : ''}}"
            data-type="solar"
            bindtap="handleDateType"
          >
            公历</button
          ><button
            class="system-choice {{dateType === 'lunar' ? 'active' : ''}}"
            data-type="lunar"
            bindtap="handleDateType"
          >
            农历
          </button></view
        >
        <picker
          wx:if="{{dateType === 'solar'}}"
          mode="date"
          start="1900-01-01"
          end="2100-12-31"
          value="{{birthDate}}"
          bindchange="handleDate"
          ><view class="picker-value"
            >{{birthDate || '请选择公历出生日期'}}　⌄</view
          ></picker
        >
        <block wx:else
          ><view class="lunar-grid"
            ><view
              ><input
                class="form-input"
                type="number"
                maxlength="4"
                placeholder="年"
                value="{{lunarYear}}"
                data-part="lunarYear"
                bindinput="handleLunarPart" /></view
            ><view
              ><input
                class="form-input"
                type="number"
                maxlength="2"
                placeholder="月"
                value="{{lunarMonth}}"
                data-part="lunarMonth"
                bindinput="handleLunarPart" /></view
            ><view
              ><input
                class="form-input"
                type="number"
                maxlength="2"
                placeholder="日"
                value="{{lunarDay}}"
                data-part="lunarDay"
                bindinput="handleLunarPart" /></view></view
          ><label class="switch-row"
            ><view class="switch-label">农历闰月</view
            ><switch
              checked="{{isLeap}}"
              color="#995239"
              bindchange="handleLeap" /></label
        ></block>
      </view>
      <view class="form-field"
        ><view class="form-label"
          >出生时刻 <text class="optional">北京时间</text></view
        ><picker
          mode="time"
          value="{{birthTime}}"
          disabled="{{unknownTime}}"
          bindchange="handleTime"
          ><view class="picker-value"
            >{{unknownTime ? '出生时刻未知' : birthTime ||
            '请选择出生时刻'}}　⌄</view
          ></picker
        ><label class="switch-row"
          ><view class="switch-label">不确定出生时刻</view
          ><switch
            checked="{{unknownTime}}"
            color="#995239"
            bindchange="handleUnknown" /></label
        ><view class="subtle-note" wx:if="{{unknownTime}}"
          >{{systemId === 'bazi' ?
          '只展示三柱参考，不排时柱和起运；节气交接日仍需补充时刻核对。' :
          '紫微排盘需要出生时辰，请补充后再生成。'}}</view
        ></view
      >
      <view class="form-field"
        ><view class="form-label">排盘性别</view
        ><picker
          mode="selector"
          range="{{genders}}"
          value="{{genderIndex < 0 ? 0 : genderIndex}}"
          bindchange="handleGender"
          ><view class="picker-value"
            >{{genderIndex < 0 ? '请选择排盘性别' :
            genders[genderIndex]}}　⌄</view
          ></picker
        ><view class="subtle-note">用于传统排盘中的大运顺逆等规则。</view></view
      >
      <view class="profile-consent"
        ><label class="switch-row"
          ><view class="switch-label">保存出生资料，下次自动填入</view
          ><switch
            checked="{{saveProfile}}"
            color="#995239"
            bindchange="handleSaveProfile" /></label
        ><view class="subtle-note"
          >仅保存在本机，八字和紫微共用。生成时未勾选会移除已存资料。命盘记录会保留本次出生信息，可在记录页单独删除。</view
        ></view
      >
      <button
        class="primary-button form-submit"
        bindtap="handleGenerate"
        disabled="{{systemId === 'ziwei' && unknownTime}}"
      >
        生成{{systemId === 'bazi' ? '八字' : '紫微'}}命盘
      </button>
      <button
        wx:if="{{hasSavedProfile}}"
        class="text-button delete-profile"
        bindtap="handleDeleteProfile"
      >
        删除已保存的出生资料
      </button>
      <button
        class="text-button details-toggle"
        bindtap="handleRulesToggle"
        aria-expanded="{{showRules}}"
      >
        {{showRules ? '收起时间与排盘规则 −' : '查看时间与排盘规则 ＋'}}
      </button>
      <view wx:if="{{showRules}}" class="subtle-note"
        >支持1900—2100年。按北京时间 UTC+8
        标准时，不做真太阳时及历史夏令时校正。八字以节气划分年、月，零点换日；紫微按农历年界、晚子时当日、闰月中分规则排盘。不同流派可能有差异。</view
      >
    </view>
  </block>
  <view class="subtle-note" wx:if="{{profileNotice}}">{{profileNotice}}</view>
  <include src="../../templates/reading-result.wxml" />
</view>
<include src="../../templates/review-note.wxml" />
<include src="../../templates/poster.wxml" />
